# tworow -- two visible rows -- the column count resets at the newline
#
# Single quotes matter: in double quotes $? and friends expand ONCE,
# when this file is sourced, and stay frozen for the session.
PS1='\[\e[38;5;238m\]\[\e[0m\] \u@\h \[\e[38;5;238m\]in\[\e[0m\] \w\n\[\e[38;5;238m\]\[\e[0m\] \$ '
